# Internal tooling (not relevant to published package)
CLAUDE.md
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws

# README demo gifs (~8 MB). Referenced by relative paths, which pub.dev
# rewrites to github.com/<repo>/raw/<branch>/... and serves through its image
# proxy — so they render from GitHub without being shipped in the archive.
# (flutter/packages ships its equivalents, which is why the animations archive
# is 36 MB; the rendered <img> still points at GitHub, so it gains nothing.)
# Note: pubspec `screenshots:` are served from the archive and must NOT be listed here.
example/demo_gifs/

# Mirror .gitignore so build artifacts stay out of the archive.
# A .pubignore overrides the directory's .gitignore, so these must be repeated.
# Only this directory's .gitignore is overridden — example/**/.gitignore still applies.
# Hidden files and directories (dot-prefixed) are excluded by pub automatically,
# so .dart_tool/, .idea/, .github/, .DS_Store etc. need no entries here.
*.class
*.log
*.pyc
*.swp
migrate_working_dir/
/pubspec.lock
**/doc/api/
/build/
/coverage/
